OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FFurther
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain spreading eastwards
OL,7,Fthroughout this evening and overnight,
OL,8,Fwith low cloud and hill fog likely
OL,9,Fover the moors. A warm and humid night
OL,10,Fto come, leading to an uncomfortable
OL,11,Fnight for some.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FAny overnight rain becoming
OL,14,Frestricted to the far west where it
OL,15,Fwill remain largely cloudy throughout
OL,16,Fthe day. Sunny spells and isolated
OL,17,Fshowers developing elsewhere. Feling
OL,18,Frather warm and humid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
